  "reviews": [
   {
    "text": "We were told repeatedly that there are no curves, no grade bin shifts, no extra credit points (expect for 1 extra credit point through the course eval), even if the exams were hard because they believe the exams are easy (despite the average being low). The coordinator of Bio1A do not change his mind about this. In Fall 2025, they did provide us extra questions in the final. But, they were not happy about this, and they said that we needed to study better because this class is not a weeder…",
